        "original_id": "6af18833-7e2c-5be9-a2eb-94086ea839bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Sanming, Jiutai District, Datian County, Youxi County, Yongan County, Shaxian County, Fujian province, Jilin province, Changchun, China\n- Concepts: Houlu dialect, administrative jurisdiction, prefecture-level city, district\n\nFacts:\n- Sanming is a prefecture-level city in western Fujian province, China.\n- Jiutai District is a district under the jurisdiction of Changchun, the capital of Jilin province, China.\n- Datian County is under the jurisdiction of Sanming City.\n- The Houlu dialect is spoken in northwestern Datian County, southwestern Youxi County, and some towns of Yongan County and Shaxian County in Fujian province.",
